        "track": false,
        "narration": "第三盘，德约科维奇发球，四十比十五，只差一分就能保发。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/deuce-2026/label-w23.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 15.0,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "26分钟的一局",
            "date": "2023.07.16",
            "place": "温网 决赛",
            "score": "1-6 7-6(6) 6-1 3-6 6-4",
            "people": "阿尔卡拉斯 vs 德约科维奇"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 343.0,
        "end": 345.47,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "然后，平分。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 393.5,
        "end": 398.06,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "占先，又平分。占先，又平分。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 960.0,
        "end": 965.18,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "这一局打了三十二分，十三次平分，整整二十六分钟。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1290.0,
        "end": 1296.55,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "有记录的最长一局，是一九七五年英国的一个草地赛，三十七次平分。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1614.2,
        "end": 1620.49,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "八个局点，德约都没拿下。第七个破发点，阿尔卡拉斯破发了。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1620.5,
        "end": 1635.85,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 7.72,
            "end": 15.16,
            "text": "And that's it, it's two breaks of serve, 32 points in that one game alone.\n结束了，两次破发，这一局32分"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 1249.6,
        "end": 1253.8,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "他拿下这一盘，最后拿下了温网冠军。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1588.0,
        "end": 1593.52,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "可网球为什么要这么打？追平了还不算，必须连赢两分？",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 600.0,
        "end": 604.46,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "网球一局，按十五、三十、四十计分。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 925.0,
        "end": 928.46,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "打到四十比四十，叫平分。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 640.0,
        "end": 645.95,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "平分以后先赢一分，叫占先；占先再赢一分，才拿下这一局。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1599.7,
        "end": 1604.2,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 1.2,
            "end": 3.25,
            "text": "Advantage, Alcaraz.\n占先，阿尔卡拉斯"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 710.0,
        "end": 715.76,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "占先时输一分，就回到平分。理论上，可以一直打下去。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 8.0,
        "end": 11.79,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "这条规矩，比现代网球老得多。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/deuce-2026/label-rt.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 15.0,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "皇家网球",
            "date": "2024.11.25",
            "place": "英国公开赛 决赛",
            "score": "2-6 6-4 6-0 6-5",
            "people": "里维埃 vs 豪厄尔"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 13.0,
        "end": 19.29,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "它来自皇家网球：在四面高墙的室内球场里打，是现代网球的祖先。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 30.0,
        "end": 34.9,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "一五五五年，意大利人斯卡伊诺写了一本球类专著。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 44.5,
        "end": 51.12,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "书里说，比分追平以后，要再赢两分才能拿下一局，意大利语就叫“差两分”。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 58.5,
        "end": 63.92,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "这个词传到法语，再被英国人念走了样，就成了今天的 deuce。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 163.5,
        "end": 168.59,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "一五九二年的巴黎规则里，平分和占先都写进了条文。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 202.5,
        "end": 210.56,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "一六四一年的一首拉丁诗，还记下了球场上的喊分：四十五平，我占先。又平分了。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 45.0,
        "end": 54.79,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "一八七七年，第一届温网定规则，直接照搬了皇家网球的计分：十五、三十、四十，连平分和占先一起搬了过来。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 427.0,
        "end": 431.13,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "后来，这条规矩还扩展到了盘和抢七。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/deuce-2026/label-w23tb.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 15.0,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "抢七打到8-6",
            "date": "2023.07.16",
            "place": "温网 决赛",
            "score": "1-6 7-6(6) 6-1 3-6 6-4",
            "people": "阿尔卡拉斯 vs 德约科维奇"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 478.0,
        "end": 482.63,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "这场决赛的第二盘抢七，就一路打到了八比六。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 432.0,
        "end": 440.98,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "唯一的例外是一九七〇年的美网：九分制抢七，四平时一分定胜负。几年后，又改回了要领先两分。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 785.0,
        "end": 789.08,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "为什么必须赢两分？算一笔账。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/deuce-2026/label-w23.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 15.0,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "26分钟的一局",
            "date": "2023.07.16",
            "place": "温网 决赛",
            "score": "1-6 7-6(6) 6-1 3-6 6-4",
            "people": "阿尔卡拉斯 vs 德约科维奇"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 790.0,
        "end": 794.27,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "ATP 发球方平均每分赢百分之六十四左右。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1050.0,
        "end": 1059.0,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "如果打到平分，要连赢两分才算数。按概率算，发球方从平分保发的机会，反而升到百分之七十六左右。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1200.0,
        "end": 1204.13,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "每一分上的小优势，被连赢两分放大了。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "mur17",
        "start": 123.2,
        "end": 131.41,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "真到了场上，因人而异。二〇一七年 ATP 统计，穆雷打到平分以后，保发率百分之八十。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "cil17",
        "start": 128.0,
        "end": 132.99,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "西里奇呢？还不到百分之六十五，反而更低。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "dbl21",
        "start": 0.2,
        "end": 5.07,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "那改成一球定胜负呢？早就有人这么干了。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
